    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Forms with se-",
     "texto": [
      "**Sebulan** means \"one month\" and **sebulan lalu** means \"a month ago\". **Seharusnya** expresses what is expected or what would be advisable. These forms are written joined together."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "A clear complaint",
     "texto": [
      "State the problem, explain what happened and add evidence if you have it. A specific request helps the recipient understand what response you expect."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
